:''This article is about the Special Event. For the Nintendo Switch game, see [[The Battle Cats Unite!]]''
'''The Battle Cats Unite!''' celebrates 300k downloads of the Japanese Version and the English release of [[The Battle Cats]] on [[The Battle Cats Unite!|Nintendo Switch]]. This event contains an exclusive cat unit along with a special stage. It was added in [[Version 8.8 Update|Version 8.8]].

==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF0000|'''The Battle Cats Unite!'''}} for Nintendo Switch teams up with the Battle Cats mobile app for a {{Color|#9900FF|'''First anniversary collab'''}}!

Visit the Event Stages/Legend Stages and select the special map {{Color|#FF0000|'''The Battle Cats Together!'''}} to take on this challenge!<br>
Celebrate the release of {{Color|#FF0000|'''The Battle Cats Unite! on Nintendo Switch'''}}, with {{Color|#9900FF|'''special collab stages'''}} available in the mobile version of The Battle Cats!

Visit the Event Stages/Legend Stages and select the special map {{Color|#FF0000|'''The Battle Cats Together!'''}} to take on this challenge!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from June 30, 2025 (11:00AM) until July 14, 2025 (10:59AM)!'''}}

Clearing each stage in The Battle Cats Together! map for a small chance to acquire the unit {{Color|#FF0000|'''Cat Bros'''}}! Your chance of earning this drop reward increases in later stages!

Also, {{Color|#4A86E8|'''get Timed Score drop rewards based on your score after clearing each stage!'''}}

Earn XP and useful items by getting high scores on each stage!

※ Check available rewards and point requirements by tapping Timed Score at the bottom left of the map screen.<br>
※ Use a Treasure Radar for a 100% guarantee to collect the Cat Bros unit.<br>
※ Activate your new unit at the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu after receiving it.

Visit The Battle Cats Unite! for Nintendo Switch website for more info (only accessible in certain countries)!

■North America<br>
https://www.nintendo.com/us/store/products/the-battle-cats-unite-switch/

■Europe<br>
https://www.nintendo.com/en-gb/Games/Nintendo-Switch-download-software/The-Battle-Cats-Unite--2596763.html

{{Color|#E97132|'''●Collab stages from The Battle Cats POP! on 3DS available!'''}}<br>
Visit Event Stages/Legend Stages and select the special maps {{Color|#FF0000|'''The Battle Cats POP!'''}} and {{Color|#FF0000|'''Cat Kart Awakens!'''}} to take on this challenge!

By clearing each stage in The Battle Cats POP! map, there is a small chance to acquire the unit {{Color|#FF0000|'''Cat Kart R!'''}} The chance to earn it increases in the later stages!

Clearing each stage of the Cat Kart Awakens! map will {{Color|#FF0000|'''unlock the True Form of Cat Kart R!'''}} Your chance of earning this drop reward increases in later stages!

Also, {{Color|#4A86E8|'''get Timed Score drop rewards based on your score after clearing each stage'''}}!<br>
Earn XP and useful items by getting high scores on each stage!

※ Check available rewards and point requirements by tapping Timed Score at the bottom left of the map screen.<br>
※ Use a Treasure Radar for a 100% guarantee to collect the Cat Kart R unit.<br>
※ Activate your new unit at the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu after receiving it.<br>
※Cat Kart R must be at Lv. 20 in order to evolve into its True Form.<br>
※Cat Kart R's True Form can be obtained even if the unit has not been unlocked.<br>
※Cat Kart R cannot be earned again if it has been unlocked in a previous collab event.

